# r1115 phase 1, boot p1cdw3: SQ-CDW-01 rerun with endersdelight removed. Group B fresh normal world, seed 424242, full pack minus one jar
# (installed mods/ only, NOSWAP=1).
# Server: NOSWAP=1 bash tools/scratch_query/prep_srv.sh OUT p1cdw3 B level-seed=424242
# Before boot: rm OUT/srv/mods/endersdelight*.jar (a hard link: the pack's mods/ keeps its jar); probes zz_hh_mw_probe.js.
pace 1

## SQ-CDW-01c | endersdelight removed: no datapack error, level created, wild crop packs line lists it under off
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject ^(?!.*json id corn_delight:).*(Failed to validate datapack|Unknown registry key|Errors in currently selected datapacks)
bootexpect \[creativedelight\] wild crop worldgen packs on: \[
bootreject \[creativedelight\] wild crop worldgen packs on: .*off.*endersdelight
shell grep -h "wild crop worldgen packs" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-300
shell test "$(ls mods | grep -c '^endersdelight')" = 0 && echo "jar gone"
shell ls kubejs/data/creativedelight/
look the level is created (Done); no worldgen dir in srv kubejs/data/creativedelight; the packs line names no endersdelight pack (it has none of its own)

## SQ-HH-328s3 | corn maze locate from spawn within the shipped 120 s deadline (seed 424242), then the maze census
> locate structure hearthandharvest:corn_maze
waitlog (?:The nearest hearthandharvest:corn_maze is at|Could not find) 200
shell grep -E "\[locate\].*corn_maze" logs/latest.log | tail -2 | cut -c1-260
capture M The nearest hearthandharvest:corn_maze is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {M1-16} {M3-16} {M1+47} {M3+47}
sleep 90
> zq under {M1} {M3} 2 corn_maze
waitlog \[zq\] done 120
> zhh2 countset {M1-2} 50 {M3-2} {M1+36} 110 {M3+36} corn_delight:corn_crop,minecraft:oak_fence,minecraft:chest,lootr:lootr_chest
> zhh2 chests {M1-2} 50 {M3-2} {M1+36} 110 {M3+36}
sleep 5
> forceload remove {M1-16} {M3-16} {M1+47} {M3+47}
expect The nearest hearthandharvest:corn_maze is at
look locate time and candidates ([locate] line); corn_crop > 100, oak_fence 16, a chest with corn_maze_center; under: no large air gap
